    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "NiBezaleli niOholiyabi ni amayala ejima akweti nyichima yama ana, anashiliyi Yehova munyichima yawu nima ana nikashinshi, kulondakwiluka kukalakala nyidimu yakukalakala nachu malala, mwejima mwalejeliyi Yehova, nindi akakalakali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosi watambikili niBezaleli niOholiyabi ni amayala ejima akwetinyi chima yama ana, ashiluwu maana munyichima kudi Yehova, ejima akwetinyi chima yayibimbishili kulonda enzi nakukoŋa mudimu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "atambwili kudi Mosi himulambu wejima waleteluwu anyana kaIsarela wamudimu wakukalakala nachu malala, kulonda kuyituŋa nachu. Habudidi habudidi hiyakuletaŋa hohu nyilambu yakunyichima yawu awenawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amayala ejima akwama ana akoŋelaŋa mudimu wamalala wejima, ashiyili wejima wawunyidimu yawu yakoŋelaŋawu, ayili nakumwila Mosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nawu, Yuma yakuletawu antu yakukalakala nachu mudimu wakutuŋa washiikiliyi Yehova, yinasweji kuvula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mosi wayilejeli, abidikishili mwahita chilombu chejima, nawu, Kwosi hela iyala hela mumbanda wakatuŋa cheŋi chuma chikwawu chamulambu wamalalaku. Chochina ayilekesheli antu kuletacheŋi yuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyuma yadiŋuwu nayu yawaninini mumudimu wejima wakutuŋa malala, yabadi kilumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hadi awa akalakeli mudimu, ejima adiŋi nanyichima yama ana, atuŋilitabanaka nimahinindi ikumi, wayituŋali nawanda wawuwahi wakushinta, niwuzeeli, niwusombu, niwanda wuchinana nge, nawakerubi akuchimina mukudi akwawukalawenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muwulehi wehina dimu munkotweli jachikasa makumi ayedi najitanu najisatu, muwihi wehina dimu munkotweli jachikasa jiwana, mahina ejima adiŋi esekana hamu hohu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mahina atanu wayinuŋili hamu, dimu nadikwawu, awa atanu nawawayinuŋili hamu, dimu nadikwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welili ŋanda jawuzeeli hansayehina dakuma kunsa yamahina mwayinuŋilawu, dichi cheliliyi nawanihansa yehina dakuma kunsa yamahina amakwawu mwayinuŋilawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welili ŋanda makumi atanu kwihina dimu, welili niŋanda makumi atanu hansa yehina dadiŋi kumahina amakwawu mwayinuŋilawu ŋanda jaditalili yimu nayikwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welili nkobu jawuru makumi atanu, wanuŋili mahinahamu nankobu, chochina tabanaka yelili yimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welili mahina amavuji ampembi kulonda ekali itenti dakubuta hatabanaka; welili mahina ikumi nadimu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muwulehi wehina dimu mwelili munkotweli jachikasa makumi asatu, muwihi wehina dimu munkotweli jachikasa jiwana; mahina ejima ikumi nadimu adiŋi esekana hamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welili mapalanga atabanaka anyitondu yanyishitimi emana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukuleha kwepalanŋa dimu munkotweli jachikasa ikumi, mukutoha kwepalanŋadi mu munkotweli yimu yachikasa nachiketu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ipalanŋa dimu dadiŋi nanyishika yiyedi yakunuŋila hamu wumu namukwawu, dichi cheliliyi namapalanga ejima atabanaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welili mapalanga atabanaka, mapalanga makumi ayedi akumutamba wakukabeta, kwokukabeta kakuchidiilu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welili nyikambu yanyitondu yanyishitimi, yitanu yakumapalanga ambaŋu yimu yatabanaka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nyikambu yitanu yakumapalanga ambaŋuyi kwawu yatabanaka, ninyikambu yitanu yakumapalanga atabanaka akumutamba wakunyima wakumujika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welili mukambu wahakachi, wahitilihakachi kamapalanga wahanukili zwa, kufuma kunsa yimu nakushika kunsa yi kwawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamapalanga walamikiluhu wuru, watupili nituzeya twawutwawuru twakushila nyikambu, hanyikambu walamikiluhu wuru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watuŋili ihina dakujika hakachi, dawuzeeli, nawusombu, nawanda wuchinana nge, nawanda wawuwahi wakushinta, niakerubi akuchimina mukudi akwawukalawenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welili yishimi yadu yiwana yanyitondu yanyishitimi, walamikiluhu wuru; mbwambu jawu jakukudikila jadiŋi jawuru, wayiwumbilili nimayanda asiliva awana akwimikila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 36:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Watuŋili ihinadakukudika muchisu chetenti, dawuzeeli, nawusombu, nawanda wuchinanange, nawanda wawuwahi wakushinta, mudimu wamukwakuchima nakusowashana, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.36.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.36.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
